	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "FFC/FPC 0.5mm pitch, 12 pin, horizontal ZIF, DUAL-SIDED contacts. Land pattern taken 1:1 from the JLCEDA/EasyEDA Official Library footprint FPC-SMD_X05A10H12G for XKB X05A10H12G (LCSC C528035): signal pads 0.30x0.80mm on 0.50mm pitch, hold-down pads 0.60x1.00mm at +/-3.75mm, body 8.0x3.8mm, 1.0mm height. PAD NUMBERING IS REVERSED on purpose: pad N = DISPLAY FPC CONTACT N, not connector pin N. The GC9A01 tape is folded 180 deg before entering the connector, which reverses contact order. Breloo project.")
